---

## Summary of Changes

**2 files modified/created:**

| File | Changes |
|:---|:---|
| `src/api/modules/chats.js` | ✅ Added `getChatLogs(chatId)` API method |
| `src/components/ChatLogsPanel.vue` | ✅ Created new panel component with rich log visualization |

**ChatLogsPanel Features:**
- ✅ **Summary stats**: Total records, duration, tokens, status overview
- ✅ **Status distribution**: Visual bar chart showing success/error/cancelled breakdown
- ✅ **Model usage**: Table of models used with request counts and durations
- ✅ **Token breakdown**: Input/output token estimates
- ✅ **Error details**: Shows first 5 error messages in error state
- ✅ **Timeline**: First/last log timestamps, session ID
- ✅ **Fallback tracking**: Shows when fallback lookup was used
- ✅ **Loading/Error states**: Proper UX for data fetching
- ✅ **Refresh button**: Manually reload logs

**Usage Example:**
```vue
<ChatLogsPanel :chatId="chat.id" />
```

The component automatically fetches logs on mount and provides a refresh button for manual reloading. 🚀

